  "id": "echo-in-jesus-name",
  "title": "Echo (in Jesus Name)",
  "artist": "Charity Gayle",
  "lyrics": [
    "[Intro]",
    "",
    "[Verse 1]",
    "   You moved the mountains",
    "   Told the wind and waves be still",
    "   You cast out demons",
    "   Bid the empty soul be filled and now there's breakthrough",
    "   Now there's freedom in Your name, You gave us power",
    "   And the keys to do the same, You hold redemption",
    "   Made accusers drop their stones, showed us mercy",
    "   With your mighty miracles, and now there's breakthrough",
    "   Now there's freedom in Your name, You gave us power",
    "   And the keys to do the same",
    "",
    "[Chorus]",
    "",
    "Now we proclaim (in Jesus name)",
    "Walls fall down (in Jesus name)",
    "Strongholds break (in Jesus name)",
    "A-men",
    "We are healed (in Jesus name)",
    "There are miracles (in Jesus name)",
    "Pour them out (in Jesus name)",
    "A-men",
    "",
    "[Verse 2]",
    "",
    "    You crushed the darkness",
    "    Made a fool of death and grave, oh King Jesus",
    "    You make royals out of slaves, and now there's breakthrough",
    "    Now there's freedom in Your name, You gave us power",
    "    And the keys to do the same",
    "",
    "[Chorus]",
    "",
    "Now we proclaim (in Jesus name)",
    "Walls fall down (in Jesus name)",
    "Strongholds break (in the name of Jesus)",
    "A-men",
